# Test preflight sentinel — created at runtime by
# tests/test_baltic_ev_fixture_bioen.py::test_baltic_ev_cod_reaches_fishery_l50_in_baseline
# only AFTER its assertion passes. Must never be tracked; tracking it
# permanently bypasses the gate that protects Task 11's FIE direction
# test from running against a non-viable cod population.
tests/.preflight_wired
